# Trivy Vulnerability Ignore File
# ================================
# This file tells Trivy to skip specific CVEs during image scanning.
# See: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/

# Alpine busybox - wget CRLF injection (MEDIUM severity, CVSS 6.5)
# Affects: apk / alpine/busybox / 1.37.0-r14
# This CVE is currently unfixable on Alpine 3.21 as no patched version has been backported.
# The fast-sim container runs a static native CLI and does not use wget at runtime, so risk is minimal.
CVE-2025-60876
